# Build-context hygiene for the Dockerfile above.
# Nothing here is needed to build the image — and `data/` / `.env` must never
# leak into a layer that could be pushed somewhere public.

# ---- version control / editor / os ----
.git
.github
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.swp

# ---- secrets ----
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# ---- local environments & caches (image installs its own) ----
**/node_modules
.venv
venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.npm
.vite
coverage

# ---- built assets: stage 1 rebuilds the SPA from source ----
frontend/dist
**/dist
**/build
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---- runtime state: api/store.py seeds it on first boot ----
data

# ---- docs, deck artefacts, dev tooling: not required at build or run time ----
docs
tools
README.md
LICENSE
scripts
*.log
*.md
!frontend/**/*.md
